{"schemaVersion":1,"id":232,"sections":[{"id":"358005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20552],"start":0,"count":22},{"id":"358005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20553],"start":22,"count":11}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":736,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:1","scriptId":20552,"text":"“我们回来了～怎么样？抓住机甲狼蛛了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":736,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:2","scriptId":20552,"text":"“还没有，不过我这里有重大发现哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":736,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:3","scriptId":20552,"text":"“什么重大发现？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:4","scriptId":20552,"text":"“哼哼，这种机甲狼蛛为什么那么强，是因为它们体内有原核体。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:5","scriptId":20552,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:6","scriptId":20552,"text":"“怎么样～吃惊了吧～我也吓一跳呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:7","scriptId":20552,"text":"“这是什么意思？狼蛛吃软泥？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":735,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:8","scriptId":20552,"text":"“我稍微分析了下，进食应该是不可能的，感觉更像是一种人为的融合……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":735,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:9","scriptId":20552,"text":"“这种融合下，狼蛛的智力和机甲活性化获得了飞跃性的提升，不再是我们所常见的那种只会杀戮和破坏的战车兽了。“","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":735,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":733,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:10","scriptId":20552,"text":"“就是变聪明了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":733,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:11","scriptId":20552,"text":"“何止如此，狼蛛身上机甲的钢铁成分也获得了提升，硬度非常惊人，所以连带着它的蛛丝也获得了强化。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":733,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:12","scriptId":20552,"text":"“应该说是进化了吧，或许我们不该叫它机甲狼蛛，改称钢铁狼蛛更好？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":733,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:13","scriptId":20552,"text":"“虽然具体原因不明，不过这种狼蛛所产的蛛丝可以让我们大赚一笔，我估计弄个几亿不成问题～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":733,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":738,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:14","scriptId":20552,"text":"“哈哈～姐姐真是商业奇才。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":738,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:15","scriptId":20552,"text":"“啊哈哈哈哈～再多夸夸我～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":738,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:16","scriptId":20552,"text":"（用原核体进行人为进化？……难道是泰莱塔……？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:18","scriptId":20552,"text":"另一边——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:19","scriptId":20552,"text":"和妮科尔通力合作后，终于把机甲狼蛛逼至了山脚下的沙漠丘陵地带。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":13,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:20","scriptId":20552,"text":"“哼，这下跑不掉了吧，逮到这家伙之后，我一定要波西娅给我们加奖金，实在是太费力气了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:21","scriptId":20552,"text":"“兔子急了都会咬人，那只狼蛛被逼入了绝境，危险系数大大提升了，大家小心应对。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:22","scriptId":20552,"text":"“以狙击脚步为主。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":596,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-PROLOGUE:20552:23","scriptId":20552,"text":"“了解～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":596,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:1","scriptId":20553,"text":"费了九牛二虎之力终于搞定了那只机甲狼蛛，用光了手头的神经麻醉弹才让它消停下来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":596,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:2","scriptId":20553,"text":"“接下来是想办法把它运回去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:3","scriptId":20553,"text":"“要拖它回营地估计很费力气……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:4","scriptId":20553,"text":"于是我们带着机甲狼蛛返回波西娅那里。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:7","scriptId":20553,"text":"“很好，虽然不知道具体能开发出何种样子的防弹装备，但我可以保证绝对是超乎你们想象的发明～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:8","scriptId":20553,"text":"“那我要求提高报酬～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:9","scriptId":20553,"text":"“就知道你会这么说，我开发完成的防弹装备无偿提供你们小队使用，如何？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:10","scriptId":20553,"text":"“我的天！？波西娅怎么那么大方？今天的太阳难道是西边出来的？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:11","scriptId":20553,"text":"“那你还不快多谢谢我～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:12","scriptId":20553,"text":"（哼哼，无偿使用权～赚翻了啊～趁波西娅高兴，得快让她立下字句～）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358005-EPILOGUE:20553:13","scriptId":20553,"text":"（如果这小子知道我之后能赚多少的话，绝对会瞠目结舌吧～呜嘻嘻嘻～）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
